BRQC - Key Encapsulation Mechanism (KEM)

This directory contains the implementation of the BRQC KEM scheme.

Directory structure:
  Reference_Implementation/     Reference implementation (pure C, no platform-specific instructions)
    BRQC-128/                   BRQC-128 (128-bit classical security)
    BRQC-256/                   BRQC-256 (256-bit classical security)
    BRQC-512/                   BRQC-512 (512-bit classical security)

  Optimized_Implementation/     Optimized implementation (AVX2/PCLMUL instruction set)
    BRQC-128/                   BRQC-128 (128-bit classical security)
    BRQC-256/                   BRQC-256 (256-bit classical security)
    BRQC-512/                   BRQC-512 (512-bit classical security)

Each instance directory contains:
  KEM_BRQC-{sec}.h/c       KEM programming interface (API_PKC standard)
  drng.c/h                 Deterministic random number generator (API_PKC)
  auxfunc.c/h              Auxiliary hash functions (API_PKC)
  KAT_KEM.c                Known answer test vector generator (API_PKC)
  src/                     Algorithm implementation sources
  lib/                     Internal dependencies
  Makefile                 Build script
  README                   Instance documentation

Programming interface:
  The implementation uses the programming interface provided by ICCS (KEM_BRQC-{sec}.h).
  Cryptographic hashing uses the provided auxiliary functions (auxfunc.h).
  Random number generation uses the provided DRNG (drng.h).
